<title>USA: Cubist says to sell $10 mln of common shrs.</title>
<headline>Cubist says to sell $10 mln of common shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cubist Pharmaceuticals Inc said Friday it entered an agreement with a group of investors to sell shares of common stock for a total purchase price of $10 million.</p>
<p>The group of investors include UBS Asset Management and Hambrecht &amp; Quist Capital Managment.</p>
<p>Cubist is a biopharmaceutical company developing drugs to treat infectious diseases caused by resistant bacteria and fungi.</p>
